    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Oskar will demo the working staging build on our sample data on Thursday 2026-11-05, with no prototype screens and no Halvorsen data. The other points about the invite, shipment data, scorecard screens, lane chart, pricing, product focus and dry run were only stated and were not confirmed.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Mei, Oskar and Gabriel, with a passed recheck, that on Thursday 2026-11-05 Oskar demos the working staging build on our sample data with no prototype screens and no Halvorsen data.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that Oskar demos the dashboard to Halvorsen on Thursday.\n- It was stated that the invite will be sent.\n- It was stated as a request to ask them for a sample of their shipment data.\n- It was stated that they will ask but their IT is slow.\n- It was stated that they will ask but their IT is slow and not to count on it.\n- It was stated that the scorecard screens will be tidied up before then.\n- It was stated that the color scale on the lane chart is off, with red currently meaning on time.\n- It was stated that that will be fixed as well.\n- It was stated that pricing would be left for the renewal call itself.\n- It was stated that Thursday will be kept to the product.\n- It was stated that a dry run will be done on Wednesday."
